Package: AdvancedResearchAnalytics
Type: Package
Title: Advanced Research Analytics Shiny Application
Version: 1.1.4
Authors@R: person("Muh. Asriadi", "AM", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: An interactive statistical analysis application for multilevel
    models, individual participant data meta-analysis, multivariate methods,
    structural equation models, data management and diagnostic analyses.
    The Shiny application and its original analysis modules are bundled
    within the package and launched with run_app().
